@@ -0,0 +1,3475 @@
+/*---------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Programmer(s): Mustafa Aggul @ SMU
+ *                Daniel R. Reynolds @ UMBC
+ *---------------------------------------------------------------
+ * SUNDIALS Copyright Start
+ * Copyright (c) 2025-2026, Lawrence Livermore National Security,
